---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="py-8">
    <div class="mb-6 space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-5xl">
      <section class="bg-white rounded-lg border p-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
          <p class="lead">
            These Terms of Service reflect the way that our business works, the laws that apply to our
            company, and certain things that we've always believed to be true. As a result, these Terms of
            Service help define our relationship with you as you interact with our services.
          </p>

          <h2 class="font-semibold">Introduction</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>This website and our mobile applications are products of CODE FOR PAKISTAN.</li>
            <li>
              When using our products, you are agreeing to all of these terms, and our <a href="/privacy" class="text-sky-500 no-underline hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> on
              how we collect and store your personal data.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="font-semibold">Obligations</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              You agree that: (1) you are 10 years or older, (2) you'll have only one account in your own
              real name, (3) you're not already restricted from using our Services.
            </li>
            <li>
              You agree that: (1) you will keep your credentials secret, (2) you will not share your
              account with anyone else, and (3) you will follow our rules and the law.
            </li>
            <li>
              You're okay with us using our website and email to provide you with important notices. Also,
              you agree certain additional information can be shared with us.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="font-semibold">Rights and Limits</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              You own all of the personal information you provide us, but you also grant us a non-exclusive
              license to it. Any personally identifying information will not be disclosed to any third
              party.
            </li>
            <li>
              We may change or discontinue any of our Services. We can't promise to store or keep showing
              any information and content you might have been part of.
            </li>
            <li>
              We have the right to limit how you connect and interact on our Services. We reserve all of
              our intellectual property rights in the Services.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="font-semibold">Disclaimer</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              To the extent permitted under law, we disclaim any and all implied warrantees and
              representations. We do not guarantee that the Service will function without interruption or
              errors. The Service (including content and information) is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS
              AVAILABLE" basis.
            </li>
            <li>
              To the extent permitted under law, we shall not be held liable to you or others for any
              damage, or loss, or anything else.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="font-semibold">Miscellaneous</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>We can each end this Agreement anytime we want.</li>
            <li>
              We respect the intellectual property rights of others. We try to ensure that our content is
              not in violation of any intellectual property right of third parties.
            </li>
            <li>
              In the unlikely event we end up in a legal dispute, it will take place in Pakistani courts,
              applying Pakistani law.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
